{"sections":[{"slug":"Whitehead乘积","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Whitehead乘积"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Whitehead <span lang=\"zh\">乘积</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Whitehead 乘积”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whitehead_product\" title=\"Wiki [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whitehead_product]\">Wiki</a></span></p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">给定</span> $f \\in \\pi_k(X), g \\in \\pi_l(X)$, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span> Whitehead <span lang=\"zh\">乘积</span> $[f,g] \\in \\pi_{k+l-1}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">定义如下</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">球的乘积</span> $S^k \\times S^l$ <span lang=\"zh\">可视为一点并</span> $S^k \\vee S^l$ <span lang=\"zh\">粘上一个</span> $(k+l)$-<span lang=\"zh\">胞腔</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">设其粘贴映射为</span> $\\phi \\colon S^{k+l-1} \\to S^k \\vee S^l$. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>\n$$\r\n[f,g] \\colon  S^{k+l-1} \\overset{\\phi}{\\to} S^k\\vee S^l \\overset{f\\vee g}{\\to} X.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, $\\pi_1(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">可作用于每个</span> $\\pi_k(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">双线性性</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $g,h\\in\\pi_l(X)$, $[f,g+h] = [f,g]+[f,h]$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">分次交换性</span></strong>. $[f,g] = (-1)^{kl}[g,f]$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">分次</span> Jacobi <span lang=\"zh\">恒等式</span></strong>. $(-1)^{kl}[[f,g],h] + \\cdots = 0$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\operatorname{id} \\colon S^2 \\to S^2$ <span lang=\"zh\">为恒等映射</span>, $\\eta \\colon S^3 \\to S^2$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hopf纤维化","text":"Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">纤维化</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则有</span> $[\\operatorname{id},\\operatorname{id}] = 2\\eta$. <span lang=\"zh\">参见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hopf不变量","text":"Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">不变量</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}